  "privacyTitle": "Privacy and data",
  "privacyBody": "Guests can browse the home screen, the procedures list, the workplace and the library; settings stay on this device. Tests, practice, daily questions, procedure details, groups and “Feedback & help” need a free account (email code, Google or Apple). Then data is stored on Cloudflare’s network (servers may be outside Uzbekistan): your email only as a hash and a masked form, sign-in method, role, language, last activity time (to the minute); in a group — your nickname or sequence number, test answers and scores; the text of requests and complaints. From Google/Apple only the account identifier and email are used; the token is not stored. A teacher sees only their own group. No ads, analytics or tracking. You can delete your account at any time with the “Delete account” button. Full text: the “Privacy policy” link.",
  "privacyBodyLocal": "This build has no server connected: the app sends nothing to a server. Settings, bookmarks and practice results stay on this device (they may be included in the device backup). No ads or tracking.",
  "privacyTerms": "Terms of use",
  "privacyTermsSub": "Rules for using the app",
