  "privacyDeleted": "Local data deleted",
  "termsTitle": "Terms of use",
  "termsFullText": "Full terms of use",
  "termsFullTextSub": "On the nurseguide.nfcstore.uz website",
  "termsBody": "NurseGuide is a free reference and learning app for nurses. By using the app you agree to these terms.\n\n1. Medical limitation. NurseGuide does not diagnose, prescribe treatment or medicines, and does not replace your institution's approved procedures, medicine instructions or a physician's orders. Every item shows its source; when making decisions, rely on the original source and your institution's rules.\n\n2. Account. The main features (tests, practice, daily questions, procedure details, groups, support requests) require an account (email code, Apple or Google). You are responsible for your account's security and for actions taken through it. You can delete your account at any time: Profile → Privacy and data → Delete account.\n\n3. Teacher and student groups. When a student joins a group, the teacher sees their nickname (or seat number) and test results. Teachers use groups for educational purposes only.\n\n4. User content. You are responsible for what you write in support requests. Abuse, illegal content, advertising, other people's personal data and non-consensual intimate images are strictly prohibited. Such content is removed, and the offending account may be restricted or deleted.\n\n5. Copyright. The app's texts, slides, tests and design belong to the NurseGuide authors; external sources are shown with their own licences. They may not be copied or distributed for commercial purposes.\n\n6. Service. The app is provided “as is”; outages and errors may occur, and we fix them as quickly as we can. We will notify you in the app if these terms change.\n\n7. Privacy. How your data is used is described in the privacy policy: nurseguide.nfcstore.uz/privacy\n\n8. Contact: nurseguide@nfcstore.uz",
